Deployment address records land here as JSON files keyed by network:

- base-sepolia.json   ← written after `forge script DeployV2.s.sol --broadcast`
- base.json           ← reserved for mainnet (post-grant)

Schema:
  {
    "network": "base-sepolia",
    "chainId": 84532,
    "deployedAt": "ISO-8601 timestamp",
    "deployer": "0x...",
    "enrollmentRegistry": "0x...",
    "ultraVerifierV2": "0x...",
    "petitionRegistryV2": "0x...",
    "oprfAttester": "0x...",
    "creationDeposit": "1000000000000000",
    "genesisRoot": "0x000...000"
  }
